# SYNCROZZ — Automatic Configuration by Default
# No manual environment variables or secrets are required to run, build, preview, or deploy.
#
# - Firebase client & token verification: loaded automatically from firebase-applet-config.json
# - CORS allowed origins & app URL: derived automatically from Firebase Hosting domains,
#   configured production domains, request host, and platform runtime headers/variables
# - Playwright browser path: auto-detected from Playwright defaults / Dockerfile / system paths
#
# Optional infrastructure-only overrides (leave unset for automatic behavior):
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# VITE_SNAPSHOT_API_BASE_URL=